      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177838\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177838\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Five-percent damped design spectral response acceleration at short periods, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">S<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">DS<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, and at 1-s period, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">S<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">D1<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, shall be determined from Equations 16-46 and 16-47, respectively:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177839\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177839\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">S<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">DS <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">= 2\/3 S<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">MS<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">(Equation 16-46)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177840\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177840\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">S<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">D1<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\"> = 2\/3 S<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">M1<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">(Equation 16-47)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177841\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177841\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>where: <\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177842\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177842\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span>S\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">MS&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;\">=&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">MCE<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">R<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t spectral response accelerations for short period as determined in Section 1613.3.3.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177843\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177843\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span>S\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">M1&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;\">=&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">MCE<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">R<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t spectral response accelerations for 1 second period as determined in Section 1613.3.3.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "3596-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "Five-percent damped design spectral response acceleration at short periods, S DS \n\n , and at 1-s period, S D1 \n\n , shall be determined from Equations 16-46 and 16-47, respectively:\n\n S DS = 2\/3 S MS (Equation 16-46) \n\n S D1 = 2\/3 S M1 (Equation 16-47) \n\n where: \n\n S\n\n MS = \n The MCE R \n\n spectral response accelerations for short period as determined in Section 1613.3.3.\n\n S\n\n M1 = \n The MCE R \n\n spectral response accelerations for 1 second period as determined in Section 1613.3.3."
